.png", "id": "920856615987670", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75289916_920856619321003_1167628786352568211_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z-IHmsCuMSEQ7kNvwEThDmg&_nc_oc=AdkpCWgDe10DkLEc1oMa_E1niWdQSLigsmZt14RI5oh6bJC_il1K49aoHU2yXHBTROs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzcweBxxVHWeT_j9EpEYC8GrvuwTYPxIoTGxzUNIBNM7w&oe=69AD7618"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5_2560_1440.png", "id": "727856879468758", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974812_727856882802091_1641997799950234504_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6to8BIsRWlIQ7kNvwGYEUit&_nc_oc=AdneZPnxCgYtRbUEZROdzb5apR5BXtEYre5mudUCK7C8KcPW0qw7KqAtQXgK_g5iAdA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwqxWE9MJQkXmZfFg74lcY-RrzwtuTYZ-3598o8c56_8Q&oe=69AD7340"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Galateum_CoverLandscape.png", "id": "684438640283334", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_684438646950000_5562717609088558112_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s_4qXAXSpU4Q7kNvwExrgrD&_nc_oc=AdkWnu8GbxQPBvQrmbId7jQ90LgrdjUu83182SlECkHXQ5o3djT_OdOQ0BaTqBxuCpw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxptLr-qv0TtnGJ0zxswb0vWvvX-BEozz-kJ-pWuRbNJA&oe=69AD7373"}, "display_name": "Galateum", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in our unique FPS experience, combining cyberpunk aesthetics with the merciless conditions of a desert planet. Navigate neon-lit buildings and desolate vistas, outmoving and outplaying your opponents.\nCombat isn't just about force - it's about strategy and adaptation. Leverage the jet-pack to traverse the environment, using the map's entire verticality, while engaging in intense gun fights.\nYour cyberpunk survival odyssey starts here.\n\n", "short_description": "Dive into a unique FPS experience on a harsh desert planet. Challenge yourself and other p